# Internal design documents. Committed to git on purpose, but not part of the
# published package.
docs/

# A .pubignore replaces the root .gitignore for the whole package, so
# everything below restates that file. Any pattern left out ships from
# whoever runs `pub publish`: example/build/ once meant 87 MB of Dart
# compiler .dill caches in the tarball, and 1.7.0 through 3.0.1 shipped the
# publisher's IntelliJ flutter_khipu.iml. Keep this list a copy of .gitignore.
*.class
*.log
*.pyc
*.swp
.DS_Store
.atom/
.buildlog/
.history
.svn/
migrate_working_dir/
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
.idea/
/pubspec.lock
**/doc/api/
.dart_tool/
build/
